UE-127_2-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-127-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Lord Uthlain (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTG9yZF9VdGhsYWluP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Lord Uthlain</span><sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-127_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-127-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Uthmere (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6SW5oYWJpdGFudHNfb2ZfVXRobWVyZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Inhabitants of  Uthmere</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Uthmere\" title=\"Category:Locations in Uthmere\">Locations in  Uthmere</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Uthmere\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Uthmere\">Organizations in  Uthmere</a></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Uthmere</b> was a port town in the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Dale\" title=\"Great Dale\">Great Dale</a> on the shore of the <a href=\"/wiki/Easting_Reach\" title=\"Easting Reach\">Easting Reach</a>. It was left high and dry when the <a href=\"/wiki/Sea_of_Fallen_Stars\" title=\"Sea of Fallen Stars\">Sea of Fallen Stars</a> receded following the <a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\">Spellplague</a>. By the <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">Year of the Ageless One, 1479 DR</a>, it had transformed into a walled village that functioned primarily as a trading post.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p135_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p135-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Uthmere?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dt>Official buildings</dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>The <span class=\"new\" title=\"Hall of the Just (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSGFsbF9vZl90aGVfSnVzdD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Hall of the Just</span>, a former temple of <a href=\"/wiki/Tyr\" title=\"Tyr\">Tyr</a> which was converted to serve as the city hall.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p135_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p135-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Lord's Palace (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTG9yZCUyN3NfUGFsYWNlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Lord's Palace</span><sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-127_2-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-127-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<dl><dt>Inns &amp; Taverns</dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Bloody Hook (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmxvb2R5X0hvb2s/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Bloody Hook</span><sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-127_2-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-127-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Captain's Loft (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2FwdGFpbiUyN3NfTG9mdD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Captain's Loft</span><sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-127_2-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-127-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<dl><dt>Temples &amp; Shrines</dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hall_of_Brilliant_Justice\" title=\"Hall of Brilliant Justice\">Hall of Brilliant Justice</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-127_2-10\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-127-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Hidden House of the Master's Shadow (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSGlkZGVuX0hvdXNlX29mX3RoZV9NYXN0ZXIlMjdzX1NoYWRvdz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Hidden House of the Master's Shadow</span><sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-127_2-11\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-127-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<dl><dt>Roads &amp; Streets</dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Great_Road\" title=\"Great Road\">Great Road</a>, which connected the village to points east in the Great Dale.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p134_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p134-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Uthmere?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Following the receding of the sea, most of the townsfolk fled to <a href=\"/wiki/Impiltur\" title=\"Impiltur\">Impiltur</a>. The remaining villagers, as well as the farmers of the surrounding lands, were known to treat outsiders fairly.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p135_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p135-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Uthmere?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Uthmere?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCG-p135-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p135_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p135_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p135_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p135_1-3\">1.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p135_1-4\">1.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p135_1-5\">1.5</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bruce_R._Cordell\" title=\"Bruce R. Cordell\">Bruce R. Cordell</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Sims\" title=\"Chris Sims\">Chris Sims</a>&#160;(August 2008). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Campaign Guide\">Forgotten Realms Campaign Guide</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Jennifer_Clarke_Wilkes\" title=\"Jennifer Clarke Wilkes\">Jennifer Clarke Wilkes</a>, <i>et al</i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 135. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4924-3\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4924-3\">978-0-7869-4924-3</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-UE-127-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a h